      ],
      "argument": [
        "Private data starts NULL. bAllowMmap registration failure immediately destroys and returns; if registration was skipped, failure cleanup only unregisters a non-null private wrapper.",
        "The peer-IO descriptor destructor is installed only after IOMMU map succeeds and itself returns on null private data. This backend never publishes the peer wrapper."
      ]
