      "argument": [
        "All three static import constructors return immediately unless DMA-BUF fd, DMA-BUF pointer or GEM/SGT import succeeds. Those imports always refuse in this profile.",
        "Only after that success do the two static creation helpers call the sole nv_register_sgt site. Its own failure returns before publishing any teardown callback.",
        "Cleanup unregister and destructor callbacks require successful registration; publication occurs only after successful IOMMU mapping. No Linux scatterlist metadata is fabricated."
      ]
